Subject: [PATCH 0954/3799] soh: rename func_80B85B28 ->
 ItemEtcetera_KillOnTreasureFlag

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the action installed for the chest-game item params; it only kills the actor once the matching treasure flag is set.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Etcetera/z_item_etcetera.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Etcetera/z_item_etcetera.c    | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Etcetera/z_item_etcetera.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Etcetera/z_item_etcetera.c
index 0f6539bc4..214d61f6c 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Etcetera/z_item_etcetera.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Etcetera/z_item_etcetera.c
